		"name": "Restful-Booker API - Automated",
		"description": "# Restful-Booker API: automated tests\n\nAutomated checks for the public Restful-Booker API (https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com).\nThe requests run as one chain: auth, create, read, update, partial update, delete, verify.\n\n## How to run\n1. Select the collection and click **Run** (the order of requests matters).\n2. Or with Newman: `newman run restful-booker.automated.postman_collection.json`\n\n## Variables\n- `base_url`: API address\n- `token`: saved by `[TC-AUTH-001]`\n- `bookingId`: saved by `[TC-BKG-003]`\n\nThe public API resets its data every 10 minutes and is rate limited,\nso avoid running the collection repeatedly in a short time.\n",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "54311152",
		"_collection_link": "https://www.postman.com/testing-bblt26-2613495/workspace/restful-booker-api/collection/54311152-a8efc26b-2338-464b-897b-9ca982b17eaf?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=54311152"
	},
